# Screenshots and recordings stay out of git (MEH-3534). QA evidence goes to the
# folder linked from the PR body; the old files are in history, see
# docs/media-archive.md. Text evidence (md/json/log) in these folders is still
# tracked. scripts/checks/heavy-media-guard.sh is the gate; this only stops an
# accidental `git add`.
